# ============================================================
# GPPS Duplicate Attachment Names (read-only)
#
# Finds docName values that appear as an ACTIVE attachment (appendix[] or
# guidance[], actvFlg == "Y") on more than one policy -- i.e. the same
# physical filename is referenced by multiple policies, whether that's a
# genuinely shared/common document (e.g. a group-wide policy attached to
# several country policies) or a naming collision between unrelated files
# that just happen to share a name (e.g. "Appendix_A.docx").
#
# This only reads BigQuery -- it never touches either GCS bucket, since
# the question is about what the JSON records reference, not what's
# physically present in a bucket.
#
# Scope: the latest version per policy_core_id (same PUBL-first,
# fallback-to-highest logic used everywhere else in this project), across
# all 54 country tables + Global, discovered live.
# ============================================================

